{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/622556-when-a-shadow-botches-their-dark-passion","id":622556,"title":"When a Shadow botches their Dark Passion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-10T12:43:11-07:00","id":622556,"title":"When a Shadow botches their Dark Passion","content":"I couldn't find anything in the rules that states what happens if they do. In some other botches (such as when in Cartharsis) they're noted as losing a point of temporary Angst, does this happen when they botch their Dark Passion roll too?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T12:57:34-07:00","id":622568,"title":"","content":"As a bonus question to Wander's, can a Shadow lose a point of <b>permanent</b> Angst for any reason?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7234-the-dreamweaver","name":"The Dreamweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7234_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"358"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-10T14:16:25-07:00","id":622642,"title":"","content":"Let me see if I can dredge up some answers from my memory-hole...<br /> <br /> If a Shadow botches a Dark Passion roll, the Wraith gains a point of Pathos.<br /> <br /> A Shadow may spend a <u>permanent</u> point of Angst to completely &quot;refill&quot; its temporary Angst.<br /> <br /> I'll cite sources later if they're needed, but I'm pretty sure they're buried deep in the books somewhere.<br /> <br /> Cheers!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you don't use an Oxford comma, I feel bad for you, son,<br /> 'Cuz I got ninety-nine problems, but clarity ain't one.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/408-nothing","name":"nothing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar408_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T04:46:14-07:00","id":623219,"title":"","content":"And to add the $20,000 question. What does that feel like for the Psyche?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T16:20:50-07:00","id":623741,"title":"","content":"I would guess if the Shadow has decided to keep the Psyche's senses 'on' for the Cartharsis, the Psyche gets a real emotional burst of feeling amazing and wanting to keep going when the Shadow has taken control but messed up... Think of a spouse cared for by the Psyche, but the target of a Shadow, that botches a roll to shoot said spouse as the Psyche is stuck watching... Time for the Psyche to feel good and laugh at the Shadow, methinks... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\"